   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ECO201 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 13 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 14481 · Decision 1028/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 21/08/2026 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ECO201 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>13 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 14481 · QĐ 1028/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 21/08/2026 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Recognize the overview of world trade, cause of trade, the pattern of word trade, the way of word trade has evolved over time</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Identify the the main Traditional Models of International Trade</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Understand the Imperfect Competition and New Theories of International Trade</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>State the linkages between trade, labor and capital movements, international fragmentation of production, economic well-being and the income distribution and to identify and critically examine policy implications of these linkages</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Identify International factor mobility</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Analyze instruments and consequences of trade policy measures</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Discuss the political economy of Trade Policy: the motivation for protectionist policies, examples of current trade agreements, Recent controversies in trade policy and trade retaliation, Trade policy in developing countries, links between trade and the environment.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>CLO8</strong></td><td>Understand the exchange Rates, Price Levels and Money</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>9</td><td><strong>CLO9</strong></td><td>Analyze clearly the intertemporal approach to current account, balance of payments and the trade balance;</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>10</td><td><strong>CLO10</strong></td><td>Demonstrate the global capital market: performance and policy problems</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>11</td><td><strong>CLO11</strong></td><td>Identify the idea of optimum currency areas</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>12</td><td><strong>CLO12</strong></td><td>Demonstrate the understanding of Growth, Crises and International Speculation</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>13</td><td><strong>CLO13</strong></td><td>Link theoretical foundation to practical issues/implications</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14481\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14481</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14481\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14481</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
